    "description": "Execute basic actions on the last observed window. control_id clicks prefer direct UIA invocation; pointer input restores focus. Points use the last state's coordinateSpace (image_pixels when a screenshot was returned, otherwise window pixels). Mapping is internal. Stops on failure without replay.",
